# Keep the build context small. The Dockerfile.fly build copies only
# media-ingest-c/{Makefile,src} and scripts/py1337x-json.py, but without this the
# context would still ship node_modules, the extractor venv and prior builds to
# the builder — tens of thousands of files for nothing.
**/node_modules
**/.toolchain
**/dist
media-ingest-c/build
downloads
.git
.openhands
